@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, sql
+    :tickets: 11426
+
+    Fixed bug in :meth:`_sql.FunctionFilter.filter` that would mutate
+    the existing function in-place. It now behaves like the rest of the
+    SQLAlchemy API, returning a new instance instead of mutating the
+    original one.
